// T30 (RFC §14): symbolic unbounded `Int` exploit requiring 2 steps:
// 1. At `--depth 1` with `--min-depth 2`, SMT reports INCONCLUSIVE (exit 3) rather than pass.
// 2. At `--depth 2`, SMT extracts threshold witness `10000` (without any `explore-domain` menu!),
//    replays natively in `Charter.Eval`, and finds the exact 2-step exploit!
Fact actor_t Identified by Eve.
Fact staged Identified by int.
Fact drained Identified by int.

Act stage-withdrawal Actor actor_t Related to int
  Holds when int > 9999
  Creates staged(int).

Act finalize-withdrawal Actor actor_t Related to int
  Holds when staged(int)
  Valid when staged(int)
  Creates drained(int).

Invariant cap-preserved
  When !(Exists drained: drained.int > 9999).
